181
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:21,800
So I did a self-reflection.

182
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,800
I compared some of the time we spent developing designs,

183
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:29,800
as well as the selection rate of our design designs.

184
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:35,800
After the comparison, I found that if we use the traditional way of thinking to use 3D,

185
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:38,800
which is to draw an effect picture,

186
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:41,800
create a 3D version, and then simulate it with Clover,

187
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:44,800
and sew the costume.

188
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,800
What did we find?

189
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,800
When we didn't use 3D,

190
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,800
maybe it was in 2017 or 2018,

191
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,800
our designer drew a design,

192
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,800
and it might take half a day,

193
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,800
