194
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:59,800
and it might take a day to line it up.

195
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,800
After half a day of training,

196
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:03,800
the designer gave us a sample of the sample,

197
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:05,800
and then the board was modified.

198
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:08,800
After the training, the designer confirmed it.

199
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:11,800
After the confirmation, it might take another two days to line it up,

200
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,800
and finally, the actual sample is completed.

201
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:14,800
After this process,

202
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,800
it might take a few days,

203
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,800
14 days, or almost half a month,

204
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,800
14 to 15 days.

205
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:24,800
After we started using 3D software in 2019,

206
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:27,800
we found that our designer still needed half a day to draw a picture,

207
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:30,800
and so did the board.

208
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,800
Then we lined it up for a day.

209
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,800
The only change might be here.

210
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:39,800
We are now using Clover 3D for a special simulation.

211
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:42,800
It might take from half a day to two hours.

212
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,800
But actually,

213
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:48,800
the cost of the 3D model and the cost of the sample is similar.

214
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,800
The cost is not too much.

215
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,800
It might take more than two hours,

216
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,800
and then the designer gives an opinion,

217
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,800
and then the board continues to be modified.

218
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,800
After the designer confirmed it,

219
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:02,800
we still need to line up for another two days to make a sample.

220
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,800
It is clearly digitized.

221
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,800
It is also a one-time modification.

222
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,800
It used to take 14 working days,

223
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:12,800
but it still needs 13.5 working days to make a sample.

224
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:15,800
Our efficiency may have improved a little bit,

225
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:21,800
but the designer's monthly production may also be reduced.

226
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:25,800
Then our model may also need to be fine-tuned

227
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:28,800
before it can be put into the promotion work,

228
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,800
as I said earlier.

229
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,799
We have calculated it carefully,

230
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,799
