234
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:44,799
Let the designer simulate with a 3D modeling machine.

235
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:47,799
Our 3D modeling machine may do something more professional,

236
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:51,799
such as the design of the client or the long-term modeling.

237
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:57,799
In this way, we can increase the time and efficiency of the 3D modeling machine.

238
00:08:57,799 --> 00:09:00,799
But we found that if we use this process,

239
00:09:00,799 --> 00:09:05,799
the designer's design style time will also be reduced.

240
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:07,799
This will also cause such a problem.

241
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:09,799
At the same time,

242
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:11,799
it may also take more than ten days.

243
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:12,799
There is no change.

244
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:18,800
This will greatly reduce our design time or simulation cycle.

245
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:21,800
Let's assume that there is no intermediate environment.

246
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:24,800
If the designer does not know how to model,

247
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:28,800
