252
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:40,800
It is almost from the first cycle to the second cycle.

253
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:41,800
This way, the model will be simulated.

254
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:44,800
If the designer knows how to model a 3D model,

255
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:47,800
for example, a designer who knows how to model a 3D model,

