261
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:09,800
It may take one to two days or two to three days.

262
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:10,800
This way, the model can be simulated.

263
00:10:10,800 --> 00:10:13,800
It is a very, very fast process.

